  "description": "Idiomatic .NET library for Visual FoxPro and dBase database files: read AND write .dbf tables, .fpt/.dbt memos, .cdx/.idx indexes, and .dbc database containers (long field names, code pages, NULL/_NullFlags, Varchar). Includes append/update/PACK/ZAP, VFP-compatible record locking, create-DBF/ALTER, create-DBC, CDX (re)indexing, a VFP expression engine with MACHINE/GENERAL collation, a Rushmore-style query optimizer with a SYS(3054)-style ShowPlan (SET EXACT/DELETED/OPTIMIZE semantics, late materialization, an adaptive sparse/dense bitmap, an optional memory-mapped read backend), a VFP-SQL parser + work-area session + executor (SELECT/JOIN/UNION/subqueries, DML, DDL), and the opt-in Highlike cost-based query accelerator (statistics, histograms, cross-query index cache) — all in one package. Output is byte-compatible with the real Visual FoxPro 9 runtime. Primary target Visual FoxPro.",
